WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.211 --> 00:00:03.090
(gentle uplifting music)

2
00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.890
Here's a little weekday motivation

3
00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.420
from someone who inspires us.

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.980 line:15%
Hey Drew, it's Arianne Phillips.

5
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.340 line:15%
I'm a costume designer here in Hollywood.

6
00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.970
You might know my work from movies like,

7
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.530
Girl Interrupted or Walk the Line,

8
00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.370
Kingsman the Secret Service,

9
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.020
or Once Upon A Time In Hollywood.

10
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.130
Looking back, I would've never ever thought

11
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.210
that I would be a costume designer,

12
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.370
let alone a three time Oscar nominated costume designer.

13
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:35.370
It's really for me about following your instinct

14
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.060
and being curious and saying yes.

15
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.390
I mean, my mantra is yes.

16
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.890
Being able to be open to new experiences

17
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.700
and new opportunities.

18
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.830
One of the most incredible things

19
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.530
about being a costume designer

20
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:53.800
is being part of this incredible tribe of women.

21
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.850
We are nearly 85% women

22
00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.670
within the costume designers in the film industry.

23
00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.230
Talk about girl power,

24
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.530
this month during women's history month,

25
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.630
we are coming together as a group

26
00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:11.340
to talk about pay equity because we are paid 30% less

27
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.410
than other creative department heads,

28
00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.340
who are predominantly male.

29
00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:19.640
The fact that we can come together

30
00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.820
as women in the industry

31
00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:26.090
and stand up and talk about the work that we do is really

32
00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.310
something that inspires me every day.

33
00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.448 line:15%
Thank you for sharing that with us.

34
00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:35.615 line:15%
(bright upbeat music)

